# package|strategy|origin|canonical_path|delta_directory
#
# Every package built by AudioWRT must declare where its implementation comes
# from. `openwrt-derived` packages are materialized at build time from the
# canonical package directory of the selected OpenWrt release/feed commit, then
# receive only the AudioWRT delta stored in audiowrt-packages.
#
# Strategies:
#   audiowrt-owned    package implementation is owned by AudioWRT
#   third-party       AudioWRT owns the recipe because OpenWrt has no canonical package
#   openwrt-selector  package only selects an official exact-release OpenWrt package
#   openwrt-prebuilt  package repacks exact-release OpenWrt binary artifacts
#   openwrt-derived   package inherits exact-release recipe, files and patches
#
# Origins for openwrt-derived/openwrt-selector:
#   base      selected openwrt/openwrt source tree / SDK
#   packages  official packages feed from the selected SDK feeds.conf.default

